  (text "What this does: Measures air pressure with the TE MS5607, independently of the Bosch sensor.\nConnects to: Its own flight-MCU I2C bus, address 0x77, supplied through R3501, a 47 ohm link from FLIGHT_3V3 (D-6.6, D-2Nov.3). Both pressure readings go to the estimator; neither proves full-envelope height."
    (at 15.24 27.94 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "cd65fdf3-c349-5821-92db-ce403a7b5306")))
